  "description_short": "Half-day and full-day summer programs on a working certified organic farm in Cohasset, MA, for children ages 3.5-14 plus a Counselor-in-Training program for ages 12-15. Children care for farm animals, garden, explore woods, marsh and pond habitats, and do art, cooking and outdoor skills, in groups by age.",
