  "refund_policy_summary": "Cancellations must be in writing. More than 3 weeks before the session start: refund minus a $100 fee per child per week ($15 for CIT). Less than 3 weeks before: no refund, unless the spot is refilled (then refund minus $100). Session changes count as cancellations, except swaps made within 72 hours of registering and by Feb 15, which cost $50. Switching between half and full day is free.",
  "special_needs_notes": "Garden Goats (ages 3.5-5) campers must be reliably potty-trained (no pull-ups). Staff can give only EpiPens and inhalers, no other medication. Requests to place a child outside their age group go to the Education Director, Wendy Prentiss (wendy@hollyhillfarm.org).",
  "swim_waterfront_notes": "No swimming is mentioned. Campers explore the farm's Ice Pond, ponds and marsh habitats.",
